# Instagram AI Manager — Agent Rules

Har doim `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` ni o‘qi.

## Mahsulot

Multi-Tenant SaaS. `tenant_id` server membership’dan; client header’iga ishonilmaydi.

## Joriy holat

Foundation (JWT auth, tenant/workspace, Angular login/dashboard) **bajarilgan**.

## Taqiqlangan (ruxsatsiz)

- Media Management CRUD
- Instagram OAuth/publishing
- AI Agent / Video Factory
- Redis/Ollama o‘zgartirish
- Boot/Angular downgrade

## Stack

- `BE/`: Java 21, Spring Boot 4.1.2, `uzeduai.be`, main: `InstagramAiManagerApplication`
- `UI/`: Angular 22 standalone, feature-based
- Access token: memory; Refresh: HttpOnly cookie; CSRF: XSRF-TOKEN
- API: `/api/v1/...`; health: `/api/health`
- Response: `{ success, data, message, timestamp }`

